  "content": {
    "id": "p28-q1-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "1",
    "prompt": "Express each of the following fractions as a recurring decimal:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 3,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p28-q1-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{1}{3}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.\\overline{3}$",
          "worked": "$$10=3\\times3+1.$$ The remainder 1 repeats, so the digit 3 repeats.\n$$\\frac{1}{3}=0.\\overline{3}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q1-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{1}{9}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.\\overline{1}$",
          "worked": "$$10=9\\times1+1.$$ The remainder 1 repeats, so the digit 1 repeats.\n$$\\frac{1}{9}=0.\\overline{1}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q1-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{1}{11}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.\\overline{09}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}10&=11\\times0+10\\\\100&=11\\times9+1\\end{align*}$$ The remainder 1 repeats after two digits.\n$$\\frac{1}{11}=0.\\overline{09}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q1-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{1}{7}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.\\overline{142857}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}10&=7\\times1+3\\\\30&=7\\times4+2\\\\20&=7\\times2+6\\\\60&=7\\times8+4\\\\40&=7\\times5+5\\\\50&=7\\times7+1\\end{align*}$$ The remainder 1 repeats after six digits.\n$$\\frac{1}{7}=0.\\overline{142857}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 76
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q1-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{5}{6}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.8\\overline{3}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}50&=6\\times8+2\\\\20&=6\\times3+2\\end{align*}$$ The remainder 2 repeats, so only the digit 3 recurs.\n$$\\frac{5}{6}=0.8\\overline{3}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q1-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{2}{15}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.1\\overline{3}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}20&=15\\times1+5\\\\50&=15\\times3+5\\end{align*}$$ The remainder 5 repeats, so only the digit 3 recurs.\n$$\\frac{2}{15}=0.1\\overline{3}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q1-g",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "g",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{6}{11}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.\\overline{54}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}60&=11\\times5+5\\\\50&=11\\times4+6\\end{align*}$$ The remainder 6 repeats after two digits.\n$$\\frac{6}{11}=0.\\overline{54}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q1-h",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "h",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{5}{12}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.41\\overline{6}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}50&=12\\times4+2\\\\20&=12\\times1+8\\\\80&=12\\times6+8\\end{align*}$$ The remainder 8 repeats, so only the digit 6 recurs.\n$$\\frac{5}{12}=0.41\\overline{6}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      },
      {
        "id": "p28-q1-i",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "i",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{7}{18}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.3\\overline{8}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}70&=18\\times3+16\\\\160&=18\\times8+16\\end{align*}$$ The remainder 16 repeats, so only the digit 8 recurs.\n$$\\frac{7}{18}=0.3\\overline{8}.$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      }
    ]
  },
